  "title": "Smaller Enderpearl",
  "description": "Makes the enderpearl smaller for better vision and cleaner gameplay",
  "body": "# Smaller Enderpearl\n\nSmaller Enderpearl is a minimal PvP-focused texture pack that reduces the size of the Ender Pearl for better visibility and cleaner gameplay.\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/smaller-enderpearl\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://x.com/cr3lay\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/social/twitter-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://guns.lol/crelay\"><img src=\"https://images.guns.lol/1cdda87505111e7d02bc14dd6434d41bd00bdb1e/igN8hw.png\" alt=\"socials\"></a> \n\nA large Ender Pearl can block vision in critical moments. This pack makes the pearl smaller while keeping a vanilla-like appearance, helping you maintain full awareness during fights and movement.\n\n![Showcase](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c477cc86f730ca43801f78b0cb2d69eff258d8a9_0.webp)\n\n## Features\n\n- Reduced Ender Pearl size for improved visibility\n\n- Clean, vanilla-style textures\n\n- No performance impact\n\n- Ideal for PvP and competitive play",
